WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.383
- And let's go again. (laughs)

00:00:04.099 --> 00:00:06.420
- Oh, Freddie, my man.
- Oh, Freddie Mercury. Yes!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.470
- Yeah, my man.
- Wait, tell us about that.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:09.483
- Just lovely.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.020
There was one time

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.450
that Queen were renting
a house in Beverly Hills

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.550
and me and Elton went round

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.176
to have cocktails and other things.

00:00:18.176 --> 00:00:20.769
- (laughs) The truth! I love it!

00:00:20.769 --> 00:00:23.160
And after the cocktails
and things we'd taken,

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.700
we seriously were gonna form a band

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.923
called Nose, Teeth, and Hair.

00:00:28.923 --> 00:00:30.140
(audience laughing)

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.138
- How drunk were you with this idea?

00:00:31.138 --> 00:00:32.822
- I'm the nose, there's the teeth,

00:00:32.822 --> 00:00:34.393
and Elton had no hair, so.

00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:36.250
- [Kelly] (laughs) God!

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.228
- Cruel but fair.

00:00:37.228 --> 00:00:39.664
- That's amazing! (laughs)

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:42.080
Okay, wait! Next...

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.630
That would have been a fun
party, a fun hang. Okay.

